## File Structure

### Backend (Next.js API / Node.js)
- `src/lib/db/schema.ts`: Prisma/PostgreSQL schema definitions.
- `src/lib/transport/packet-manager.ts`: Logic for adaptive chunking and RTT measurement.
- `src/lib/security/encryption.ts`: E2EE logic (Web Crypto API wrappers).
- `src/lib/auth/roles.ts`: Logic for Reader vs Author roles.
- `src/app/api/books/route.ts`: Book management and packet delivery.
- `src/app/api/payments/route.ts`: Payment processing and unlock logic.
- `src/app/api/admin/review/route.ts`: Book submission and approval pipeline.

### Frontend (Next.js)
- `src/components/reader/ReaderCanvas.tsx`: The main cinematic reading area.
- `src/components/reader/VisualSideFrame.tsx`: The animated image panel.
- `src/components/reader/ReadingMarker.tsx`: The glowing pointer/highlight.
- `src/components/admin/GlassPanel.tsx`: Base glassmorphism layout component.
- `src/components/admin/AuthorDashboard.tsx`: Analytics and management view.
- `src/components/onboarding/RoleGateway.tsx`: Reader vs Author selection screen.
- `src/hooks/usePacketStream.ts`: Hook for adaptive data fetching and buffering.
- `src/hooks/useReadingSync.ts`: Hook for mapping pointer position to visuals/audio.

